   "stem_html": "Rickey’s Retail has the following financial information for the most recent accounting period. Prepare an income statement.\n<p><img src=\"exercises/media/1d9fa0fe4ad70720.png\" alt=\"Income statement for Rickey's Retail business. Gross sales are $864,740. Sales Returns and allowances are $47,399. The cost of goods sold is $483,237. Rent expense is $86,705. Interest expense is $1,156. Income Tax Expense is $16,185. Depreciation expense is $5,780. Salaries expense is $98,266. Utility Expense is $28,902.\"></p>",
